;+------------------------------------------------------------------
;| HEX-FVG-Breaker - DOGEUSD M5 scalp, $10 account growth
;+------------------------------------------------------------------
; doge-scalp tuned for the 10-usd-account strategy. Same engine, same
; signals; only the sizing and the guards change, because every guard
; above was set for a $100 account and a $10 account trips them all:
;
; * RiskPercent 3.0 - at $10 that is $0.30/trade, which is the smallest
;   amount the broker minimum can even express (0.01 lots x 300 pts x
;   $0.10/pt). As the account grows the size grows with it, until MaxLot
;   0.05 caps it near $500.
; * MaxStopDollars 0.0030 - stops wider than 300 pts are capped out, so
;   worst-case min-lot risk stays $0.30 = 3% of the starting balance.
; * MaxDailyLossPct 8.0 - the default 3.0 is $0.30 on a $10 account: one
;   normal stop-out kills the day. 8.0 is roughly 2-3 losses.
; * MaxTotalDrawdownPct 20.0 - same story, scaled for a small account.
; * MinFreeMarginUsd 2.0 - the default 20 is twice the account. DOGE
;   margin for 0.01 lots is pennies; 2.0 is still a 20% cushion.
;
; Trade the account up, then at a few hundred dollars switch the instance
; to doge-scalp (1.5% risk, wider stop bracket, tighter kill switches):
; MT4_PRESET2=doge-scalp in the Environment tab, redeploy, done.
;
; differs from the EA default:
;   MagicNumber: 20261015  ->  20261016
;   MaxSpreadDollars: 0.45  ->  0.0008
;   MaxSignalsPerDay: 6  ->  40
;   CloseOnWeekend: 1  ->  0
;   StopTradingHourUTC: 21  ->  24
;   StartTradingHourUTC: 1  ->  0
;   TrendTimeframe: 60  ->  30
;   TrendMode: 2  ->  0
;   FastEMAPeriod: 21  ->  9
;   SlowEMAPeriod: 50  ->  21
;   MinTrendSlopeDollars: 0.15  ->  0.0002
;   MaxDistFromEmaDollars: 9.00  ->  0.004
;   SwingLookback: 3  ->  2
;   MinSwingRangeDollars: 1.20  ->  0.0015
;   MinDisplacementPct: 55.0  ->  50.0
;   MinDisplacementAtr: 1.10  ->  0.90
;   FvgMinSizeAtrPct: 55  ->  30
;   FvgMaxSizeAtrPct: 420  ->  250
;   MitigatePct: 50.0  ->  45.0
;   EntryZonePct: 62.0  ->  55.0
;   MaxZoneAgeBars: 180  ->  36
;   RequireFVGConfluence: 1  ->  0
;   ConfluenceLookback: 60  ->  30
;   BreakerMinAtr: 0.70  ->  0.50
;   BreakerMaxAtr: 6.0  ->  4.0
;   MitigConsolBars: 4  ->  3
;   MitigConsolAtrMax: 0.65  ->  0.70
;   MitigBreakAtr: 1.20  ->  1.10
;   EntryModel: 0  ->  1
;   MaxEntryDistanceDollars: 7.00  ->  0.004
;   MinRejectionWickPct: 30.0  ->  25.0
;   MinTriggerRangeAtr: 0.35  ->  0.30
;   MinTriggerClosePct: 45.0  ->  40.0
;   MaxBarsSinceTouch: 6  ->  3
;   LimitExpiryBars: 4  ->  2
;   RiskPercent: 0.0  ->  3.0
;   MaxLot: 0.02  ->  0.05
;   MaxMarginUsagePct: 50.0  ->  20
;   StopBufferAtrPct: 25.0  ->  20.0
;   MinStopDollars: 1.20  ->  0.0015
;   MaxStopDollars: 14.00  ->  0.0030
;   Tp1Percent: 50.0  ->  100.0
;   Tp2RR: 2.5  ->  2.0
;   BreakEvenTriggerRR: 0.80  ->  0.55
;   BreakEvenOffsetDollars: 0.05  ->  0.0001
;   UseAtrTrail: 1  ->  0
;   TrailStartRR: 1.0  ->  1.2
;   MinHoldBars: 2  ->  0
;   MaxDailyLossPct: 5.0  ->  8.0
;   MaxTotalDrawdownPct: 15.0  ->  20.0
;   MinFreeMarginUsd: 40.0  ->  2
;   NotifyUrl:   ->  https://ntfy.sh/hex-doge-b652c737
;   NotifyTitle: HEX XAUUSD  ->  HEX DOGEUSD ($10)
;   NotifyMinMinutes: 2  ->  1
;   NotifyMaxPerHour: 30  ->  60
;-------------------------------------------------------------------
